ent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_2310411322819157_2308593500808932144_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=n0UGUnruwuAQ7kNvwHFkkxI&_nc_oc=Adrux-NaH7SUWScinuyOroKsd32__L-7fBA--AOZ-2e9oRXa-LGVXno3tYdAhk-Neqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9TMNSx9YrzDBL7_NkT9FZvhDWi18A_9foF5uVr8vcvAw&oe=6A30148A"}, "display_name": "Mandela Invasion VR: Alternates", "keywords": ["horror", "analog", "thriller", "alternates", "puzzle"], "long_description": "You are Joseph, an agent of the US Department of Temporal Phenomena, sent to inhabit and investigate an abandoned house in Mandela County, where an entire family has vanished without a trace.\n\nAcross the county, thousands of disappearances and unexplained murders have been reported. Witnesses claim to see the missing walking among them\u2026 but not quite as they remember. Subtle differences. Wrong expressions. Something is off.\n\nRelive the Department\u2019s classified VHS tapes and uncover the truth behind these anomalies.\n\nObserve carefully.\nTrust nothing.\nSome things are pretending to be like us.\n\nA psychological VR horror experience that drags you deep into the uncanny valley.", "short_description": "Found tapes depict events leading to mysterious disappearances and murders with no clear culprit. With no more evidence than a couple of emergency calls describing unusual behavior in certain people who appear mostly human, you will relive these VHS tapes to uncover the events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://manguevarentertainment.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Manguevar Entertainment", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://manguevarentertainment.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "6443548